sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client / Simulator
  participant A as FastAPI /detection/analyze
  participant J as JWT guard
  participant E as Hybrid engine
  participant D as SQLite
  C->>A: POST flow (ips, ports, bytes, packets) + Bearer token
  A->>J: validate token, load user
  J-->>A: user (401 if invalid)
  A->>D: INSERT network_log
  A->>E: analyze_log(log)
  E->>E: evaluate 4 rules
  E->>E: features, scaler, IsolationForest score above threshold?
  E-->>A: de-duplicated alert list
  A->>D: INSERT security_alerts, COMMIT
  A-->>C: threat_detected + triggered_alerts
  C->>A: GET /detection/alerts (dashboard polls every 2 s)
